					<appearanceTick>885000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>885000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Olisze&lt;/color&gt;, High Stellarch of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Fallen Empire&lt;/color&gt;, says that her friend has been wounded while traveling. The victim is &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Midori&lt;/color&gt;, a 49-year-old sheriff.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Olisze&lt;/color&gt; has nobody to spare to rescue &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Midori&lt;/color&gt;, but says that if you can make it to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Midori&lt;/color&gt;'s position and rescue her, she will join you.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Olisze&lt;/color&gt; says that there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_DownedRefugee</root>
