					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Creticon</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Henalux</name>
									<type>God of War</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Supremacist</relatedMeme>
								</li>
								<li>
									<name>Aropius</name>
									<type>God of Creation</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_TheistEmbodied</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Patro-Faith</name>
						<adjective>faithful</adjective>
						<memberName>Faithholder</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Man</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Man</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the blasted death-world Creticon worshipped &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Henalux&lt;/color&gt;. He saw that they were suited for life, and ordained that these worshippers would rule above all others. A warlord passed a law forbidding Faithholders from rising to the ruling classes of Creticon. A hero named Cameron McAllister tried to assassinate the warlord. He failed, but &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Henalux&lt;/color&gt; witnessed Cameron's struggle, and anointed him as the prophet of the Faithholders. Cameron destroyed the capital of Creticon with chemical bombs, killing the warlord. He took his place as ruler of Creticon - and the universe beyond.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the blasted death-world Creticon worshipped %%deity0_name%%. %%Deity0_pronoun%% saw that they were suited for life, and ordained that these worshippers would rule above all others. A warlord passed a law forbidding %%memberNamePlural%% from rising to the ruling classes of Creticon. A hero named Cameron McAllister tried to assassinate the warlord. He failed, but %%deity0_name%% witnessed Cameron's struggle, and anointed him as the prophet of the %%memberNamePlural%%. Cameron destroyed the capital of Creticon with chemical bombs, killing the warlord. He took his place as ruler of Creticon - and the universe beyond.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.549, 0.743, 0.991, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistEmbodied</li>
							<li>MaleSupremacy</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>female clothing</name>
								<def>Nudity_Female_UncoveredGroinChestHairOrFaceDisapproved</def>
								<ID>334</ID>
								<randomSeed>-888994734</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>execution</name>
								<def>Execution_Required</def>
								<ID>335</ID>
								<randomSeed>1116080449</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Henalux's Eulogy</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>336</ID>
								<randomSeed>-2088690513</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>You can hold a {IDEOLIGION_adjective} funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>You can hold a funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_336</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior Class="RitualBehaviorWorker_Funeral">
									<def>Funeral</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_MemberDied">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality">
									<def>AttendedFuneral</def>
									<compDatas>
