						<leaderTitleMale>Holy Pope</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Holy Pope</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bineunos&lt;/color&gt; shaped humanity from the dust of one thousand suns, breathing life into mankind with her stellar winds. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bineunos&lt;/color&gt; dispersed the great people of Filson, sending them into the void so that they may witness the convergence of star and soul. Though many adventurers moved against her, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bineunos&lt;/color&gt; prevented them easily, for she was Master of Space.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% shaped humanity from the dust of one thousand suns, breathing life into mankind with %%deity0_possessive%% stellar winds. %%Deity0_name%% dispersed the great people of Filson, sending them into the void so that they may witness the convergence of star and soul. Though many adventurers moved against %%deity0_objective%%, %%deity0_name%% prevented them easily, for %%deity0_pronoun%% was %%deity0_type%%.</descriptionTemplate>
