						<name>Painism</name>
						<adjective>painist</adjective>
						<memberName>Screamer</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Blind Whiphand</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Blind Whiphand</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Toron&lt;/color&gt; burned in the depths of space and time for an eternity, and her screams brought forth our reality. A blind beggar asked her, "Why have you forsaken me? I cannot even see what you have created." &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Toron&lt;/color&gt; replied, "You see more, not less, for my truth lies in the mind." Across the vast stellar distances, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Toron&lt;/color&gt;'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% burned in the depths of space and time for an eternity, and %%deity0_possessive%% screams brought forth our reality. A blind beggar asked %%deity0_objective%%, "Why have you forsaken me? I cannot even see what you have created." %%deity0_name%% replied, "You see more, not less, for my truth lies in the mind." Across the vast stellar distances, %%deity0_name%%'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</descriptionTemplate>
